packages/client-ui-settings-sync/src/client/store.ts — DeepSeek Harness snapshot store
================================================================================

This file is a trimmed copy of the DeepSeek Harness snapshot-store engine
(packages/client/store). It keeps `createSnapshotStore` plus the `SnapshotStore`
type — zustand vanilla + immer `produce` + `subscribeWithSelector`, reduced to
the bare `{ getSnapshot, subscribe }` observable this plugin's settings page
needs. It is vendored rather than depended on because the published
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-store` ships that surface only as a browser bundle,
which a Node-side test cannot import. The file carries the same attribution in
its header comment.

